   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Democratic governanc - programme UNDP</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP Democratic governanc</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme proposed to be funded by Sida forms an integral part of the UNDP Democratic Governance Programme.The overall goal of UNDP Country programme action 2006-2010 is to strengthen the effectiveness, efficiency and accountability of the government at national, regional and local levels. A large share of the programme funded by Sida deals with decentralisation and local self governance.</narrative>
